From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leaf Max-Perf <leaf@localhost>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf max-perf: reduce chunk-system RAM retention (1-CPU box)

Reduces steady-state heap on small boxes:
- UNLOAD_COOLDOWN 5s -> 2s (faster chunk free)
- RegionFileStorage non-existing cache 4096 -> 1024
- ServerChunkCache last-chunk LRU 4 -> 2

diff --git a/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/ChunkHolderManager.java b/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/ChunkHolderManager.java
--- a/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/ChunkHolderManager.java
+++ b/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/ChunkHolderManager.java
@@
-    public static final TicketType UNLOAD_COOLDOWN = ChunkSystemTicketType.create("chunk_system:unload_cooldown", null, 5L * 20L);
+    // Leaf start - max-perf: shorter unload cooldown for 1-CPU box (2s vs 5s)
+    public static final TicketType UNLOAD_COOLDOWN = ChunkSystemTicketType.create("chunk_system:unload_cooldown", null, 2L * 20L);
+    // Leaf end - max-perf
diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/storage/RegionFileStorage.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/storage/RegionFileStorage.java
--- a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/storage/RegionFileStorage.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/storage/RegionFileStorage.java
@@
-    private static final int MAX_NON_EXISTING_CACHE = 1024 * 4;
+    // Leaf start - max-perf: smaller non-existing region cache
+    private static final int MAX_NON_EXISTING_CACHE = 1024;
+    // Leaf end - max-perf
diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerChunkCache.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerChunkCache.java
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerChunkCache.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerChunkCache.java
@@
-    private static final int CACHE_SIZE = 4;
+    // Leaf start - max-perf: smaller last-chunk LRU for low-RAM box
+    private static final int CACHE_SIZE = 2;
+    // Leaf end - max-perf
